goblin-view (0.1.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * First packaged release: overlapping windows, the Alt-tap menu, the
    mouse, detach and reattach, kitty and sixel images re-emitted for the
    terminal you attach from, input methods, and the kitty protocol
    extensions per window (keyboard, colours, pointer shapes, extra
    cursors, drag and drop, file transfer).

